 "category_en": "Theme park",
 "intro_zh": "旅游区位于四川省阿坝藏族羌族自治州汶川县漩三路。以\"世界汶川、水墨桃源\"为旅游定位，是2008年5月12日汶川特大地震重建后特别开发的纪念性和文化主题景区。旅游区涵盖汶川南部的三江乡、映秀镇和水磨镇，由梦幻三江、天地映秀、水磨古镇组成。",
 "intro_en": "The tourist area is located on Xuansan Road, Wenchuan County, Aba Tibetan and Qiang Autonomous Prefecture, Sichuan Province. Positioned as \"World Wenchuan, Ink Peachland\", it is a commemorative and cultural-themed scenic spot specially developed after the reconstruction of the Wenchuan earthquake on May 12, 2008. The tourist area covers Sanjiang Township, Yingxiu Town and Shuimo Town in the south of Wenchuan, and is composed of Dream Sanjiang, Tiandi Yingxiu and Shuimo Ancient Town.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
